%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Memories_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 711d309e098fdac4ab241f8f29590fc2, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2688831135879217
    m_Localized: Yes! Do you know him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879216
    m_Localized: I set a trap for a Wizard. Apparently you came instead of him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879215
    m_Localized: I put it here on purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879214
    m_Localized: Anyway, you can't take the Dragonspine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879213
    m_Localized: I came here from Avalon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879212
    m_Localized: Calm down. I'm Tesla, the scientist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879211
    m_Localized: Hi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879210
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879209
    m_Localized: We met him on our adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879208
    m_Localized: Wizard, do you mean Emin?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879207
    m_Localized: What just happened?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879206
    m_Localized: WTF going on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879205
    m_Localized: Yea, I think so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879204
    m_Localized: Okay, let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879203
    m_Localized: He said if we bring this object he will save my girlfriend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879202
    m_Localized: I have to save my lover!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879201
    m_Localized: I guess...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879200
    m_Localized: Why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879199
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879198
    m_Localized: What!?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879197
    m_Localized: I think, we found it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879196
    m_Localized: She is the princess of Arcadia. I will marry her!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879195
    m_Localized: We must protect her from strangers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879194
    m_Localized: I think so...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879193
    m_Localized: Did you? I see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879192
    m_Localized: Yes, my King!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879191
    m_Localized: "My King, we have just brought her.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879190
    m_Localized: "Yes, my King!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879189
    m_Localized: "My Lord, we suppose, her boyfriend will come to her rescue.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879188
    m_Localized: "Thank you for your support :)\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879187
    m_Localized: "Aight then, let's find the Dragonspine!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879186
    m_Localized: "Where can we find it?\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879185
    m_Localized: "No problema =)\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879184
    m_Localized: "You can find it at Xalangwo mountain.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879183
    m_Localized: "Then, I'll be able to use my magical sphere.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879182
    m_Localized: "If you want to save your friend, bring me the Dragonspine.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879181
    m_Localized: "Bro, don't worry! We will save your girlfriend.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879180
    m_Localized: "Yeah, let's go!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879179
    m_Localized: "I love you too <3\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879178
    m_Localized: "I love you darling <3\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879177
    m_Localized: "We'll see xD\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879176
    m_Localized: "Don't worry, we'll kill him. The King wants you for himself.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879175
    m_Localized: "\"Futile, you can't trust anyone.\" he said.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879174
    m_Localized: "Our king told us to keep you safe.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879173
    m_Localized: "Maltoroz\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879172
    m_Localized: "He'll come to save me. You can't do anything.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879171
    m_Localized: "I'm going to marry Ahmettny, you can't prevent it.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879170
    m_Localized: "He is my lover! Tell him to stop bothering us.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879169
    m_Localized: "What do you want from me?\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879168
    m_Localized: "Who are you?\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073505
    m_Localized: Why don't we have together =)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073504
    m_Localized: What a beautiful day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073503
    m_Localized: I hope so, I will try my best for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073502
    m_Localized: I wonder where is Ahmettny...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073501
    m_Localized: He is busy after all...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073500
    m_Localized: Yes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073499
    m_Localized: Who is she, Erina?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073498
    m_Localized: If you find anything interesting, take it for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073497
    m_Localized: Ah, yes. But I have a request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073496
    m_Localized: She is my master.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073495
    m_Localized: Yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073494
    m_Localized: I borrowed it from her for my scientific research and she let me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073493
    m_Localized: Anyway, this object already has an owner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073492
    m_Localized: But that doesn't matter to Emin, he only thinks of himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073491
    m_Localized: This way it upsets the balance of nature.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073490
    m_Localized: But as its energy is used, absorbs energy from the surrounding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073489
    m_Localized: Dragonspine is a powerful source of energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073488
    m_Localized: So you sent them to steal!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073487
    m_Localized: I caught you, sneaky Wizard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073486
    m_Localized: Yo Emin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073485
    m_Localized: Thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073484
    m_Localized: Where is there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073483
    m_Localized: Oh, I see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073482
    m_Localized: Who is Erina?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073481
    m_Localized: But good news, we found the Dragonspine!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073480
    m_Localized: Yo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073479
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073478
    m_Localized: It's shining!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073477
    m_Localized: Sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073476
    m_Localized: What's wrong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073475
    m_Localized: He wanted to come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073474
    m_Localized: Yo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073473
    m_Localized: Follow this map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073472
    m_Localized: She is in the Castle of Avalon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879233
    m_Localized: Okay, let's check where is your friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879232
    m_Localized: So, will you lend the Dragonspine for them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879231
    m_Localized: She is also a very famous person.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879230
    m_Localized: What?! I am fully aware of this. I would avoid unnecessary use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879229
    m_Localized: Hey, they want to save their friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879228
    m_Localized: Good grief...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879227
    m_Localized: Why did you bring him??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879226
    m_Localized: WHAAAAAT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879225
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879224
    m_Localized: Yes, I'm gonna beat him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879223
    m_Localized: Hey, do you know where is Authory?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879222
    m_Localized: Yes, come with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879221
    m_Localized: Authory, the King?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879220
    m_Localized: Then, let's go to him together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879219
    m_Localized: Ohh, I see...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831135879218
    m_Localized: What adventure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073555
    m_Localized: So, are you going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073554
    m_Localized: I haven't had any friends for a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073553
    m_Localized: Yes, I live far from people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073552
    m_Localized: Wow, what a wonderful map!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073551
    m_Localized: Wow, let me see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073550
    m_Localized: What's in your hand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073549
    m_Localized: This is my garden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073548
    m_Localized: Hey, I'm Frisk. I live here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073547
    m_Localized: Wow, thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073546
    m_Localized: We have to save someone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073545
    m_Localized: Wow, what kind of place is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073544
    m_Localized: Let's go then :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073543
    m_Localized: Really?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073542
    m_Localized: Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073541
    m_Localized: Is this your first time seeing a map?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073540
    m_Localized: Oh, this is a map of the continent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073539
    m_Localized: Hey, who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073538
    m_Localized: WHAT?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073537
    m_Localized: Sure, Mr. Tesla.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073536
    m_Localized: We have to hurry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073535
    m_Localized: I've heard from strangers who say they're friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073534
    m_Localized: Yes, Emin?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073533
    m_Localized: The Princess is kidnapped!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073532
    m_Localized: We have a big problem!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073531
    m_Localized: Take me there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073530
    m_Localized: May I pass to the castle?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073529
    m_Localized: Of course, I did. haha
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073528
    m_Localized: Bye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073527
    m_Localized: I have just finally awakened!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073526
    m_Localized: Damn, I can't hit him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073525
    m_Localized: My amazing martial art!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073524
    m_Localized: Y'kidding me? Just watch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073523
    m_Localized: I will rule the world by fear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073522
    m_Localized: I am the absolute evil!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073521
    m_Localized: I'm starting this by killing all of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073520
    m_Localized: Listen, kid. I am the disaster that will befall this world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073519
    m_Localized: Stay away, girl. I will take him down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073518
    m_Localized: Hahaha. I'm garou the great monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073517
    m_Localized: You beat him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073516
    m_Localized: OMG!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073515
    m_Localized: Garou, I trust you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073514
    m_Localized: O-ok...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073513
    m_Localized: What??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073512
    m_Localized: What's wrong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073511
    m_Localized: Then, your monster game ends here xD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073510
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073509
    m_Localized: The King and the Knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073508
    m_Localized: I hope they come to an agreement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073507
    m_Localized: He's trying his best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831140073506
    m_Localized: I wish the King would come too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267825
    m_Localized: Im sama, what can you say about Erina?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267824
    m_Localized: Indeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267823
    m_Localized: You're right, they're all my creatures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267822
    m_Localized: Being a god is so boring, it's fun to watch human beings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267821
    m_Localized: If I tell you, it will spoil your fun, I suggest you watch it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267820
    m_Localized: This is my award.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267819
    m_Localized: The person who finds the Dragon Ball will be the next god candidate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267818
    m_Localized: I'm just kidding, I'm already immortal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267817
    m_Localized: Dragon ball will be mine and I will be immortal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267816
    m_Localized: He is a magic bone user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267815
    m_Localized: No, he has the ability to regenerate himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267814
    m_Localized: She will be the most important person in this story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267813
    m_Localized: Let's check out Asgard Castle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267812
    m_Localized: But I have no idea about Maltoroz.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267811
    m_Localized: Yeah, I know where is Erina sama.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267810
    m_Localized: So, what's going on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267809
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267808
    m_Localized: Here I am.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267807
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267806
    m_Localized: He will come here soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267805
    m_Localized: Do you have any clue?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267804
    m_Localized: I don't know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267803
    m_Localized: Hey, where is the Princess Erina sama?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267802
    m_Localized: We gotta find Maltoroz and Erina.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267801
    m_Localized: Welcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267800
    m_Localized: Not yet. Emin is the Wizard, I will ask him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267799
    m_Localized: He was with me, I can't find him right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267798
    m_Localized: What about Maltoroz?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267797
    m_Localized: No idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267796
    m_Localized: See you again, Authory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267795
    m_Localized: Lavinia, I will introduce you to someone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267794
    m_Localized: Yes, I want to find it either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267793
    m_Localized: I can help you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267792
    m_Localized: I'm Erina.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267791
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267790
    m_Localized: Ninja Nevoksa and Knight Ahmettny.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267789
    m_Localized: I have to stop them too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267788
    m_Localized: Who is Lavinia?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267787
    m_Localized: So what will you do now, Garou?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267786
    m_Localized: Good luck to you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267785
    m_Localized: Come with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267784
    m_Localized: Wow, really?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267783
    m_Localized: She's a hologram human I made before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267782
    m_Localized: I'll find the Dragon Ball.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267781
    m_Localized: Oh, so you are that Shadow Samurai everyone is talking about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267780
    m_Localized: Who are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267779
    m_Localized: Understood, Erina sama.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267778
    m_Localized: What about me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267777
    m_Localized: Yes, I'm strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267776
    m_Localized: Oh, I can help you if you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267831
    m_Localized: Are we sure they are all human?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267830
    m_Localized: But I see great potential in Garou as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267829
    m_Localized: Mighty warrior, Ahmettny. I'm placing my bet on him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267828
    m_Localized: I wonder who will win this game :)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267827
    m_Localized: You have created this universe just for fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2688831144267826
    m_Localized: Is Maltoroz dead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
